(4376351, 630808, 32872, '<td valign="top">OMG!!  This has a creep level way up there!!  I am not going to sleep tonight.  I guess I''ll have to stop looking at these scary clown images! Yours is a great image, but it''s too scary for me.  I''ll give you a 10!</td>', 'OMG!!  This has a creep level way up there!!  I am not going to sleep tonight.  I guess I''ll have to stop looking at these scary clown images! Yours is a great image, but it''s too scary for me.  I''ll give you a 10!', '2008-01-09 01:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
