(4376361, 628647, 32872, '<td valign="top">Finally.. A lovely clown and I never thought I would say that phrase!!! I love her she''s such a pretty clown, well-executed!</td>', 'Finally.. A lovely clown and I never thought I would say that phrase!!! I love her she''s such a pretty clown, well-executed!', '2008-01-09 01:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4376407, 630725, 76430, '<td valign="top">At first I thought it was a unicycle, but it looks like a distance measuring wheel.  Maybe he''s thinking clown, but the picture doesn''t tell me that.  Plus it''s very obviously crooked, he''s too close to the bottom and 95% of the picture is flat water.  On the good side, you have the buoy and the guy nearly on the thirds intersections.    Sorry, I can''t justify a high score.</td>', 'At first I thought it was a unicycle, but it looks like a distance measuring wheel.  Maybe he''s thinking clown, but the picture doesn''t tell me that.  Plus it''s very obviously crooked, he''s too close to the bottom and 95% of the picture is flat water.  On the good side, you have the buoy and the guy nearly on the thirds intersections.    Sorry, I can''t justify a high score.', '2008-01-09 01:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4376427, 630478, 76430, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of potential.  Good DOF.  I''d like to see his eyes and maybe some children in front of him waiting for their balloon figures.  And maybe a smile without the I''d rather not be here look.</td>', 'This has a lot of potential.  Good DOF.  I''d like to see his eyes and maybe some children in front of him waiting for their balloon figures.  And maybe a smile without the I''d rather not be here look.', '2008-01-09 01:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4376434, 630286, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice selective desaturation.  It''s all just too busy for me.  If you would have cleared off all the car supplies it would have helped a lot.  And the dangling wires are not at all attractive.  Actually I think if you had moved the wires a foot to the right and shown only the middle third of the picture it would be much better.</td>', 'Nice selective desaturation.  It''s all just too busy for me.  If you would have cleared off all the car supplies it would have helped a lot.  And the dangling wires are not at all attractive.  Actually I think if you had moved the wires a foot to the right and shown only the middle third of the picture it would be much better.', '2008-01-09 01:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4376437, 630733, 76430, '<td valign="top">Yes, I think I can see it.  Good imagination.  It''s hard to find clowns these days.</td>', 'Yes, I think I can see it.  Good imagination.  It''s hard to find clowns these days.', '2008-01-09 01:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
