(4376974, 630620, 65234, '<td valign="top">Dramatic lighting and interesting pose.</td>', 'Dramatic lighting and interesting pose.', '2008-01-09 09:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4376978, 630275, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and interesting idea.  Reflections are somewhat harsh; a bounce flash or diffuser or fill light from another direction might help with that.</td>', 'Nice colors and interesting idea.  Reflections are somewhat harsh; a bounce flash or diffuser or fill light from another direction might help with that.', '2008-01-09 09:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4376988, 629707, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute idea and punny title.  The lighting is a little awkward to me, because I can''t tell whether you wanted the shadow or not.  I think I would angle the light so the shadow fell on more of a diagonal if I wanted to keep it, or use fill flash from the side if I wanted to make it go away.</td>', 'Cute idea and punny title.  The lighting is a little awkward to me, because I can''t tell whether you wanted the shadow or not.  I think I would angle the light so the shadow fell on more of a diagonal if I wanted to keep it, or use fill flash from the side if I wanted to make it go away.', '2008-01-09 09:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4376997, 629950, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective and good DOF for this shot.  I do like the model''s expression and the curly "hair."  Whites look a little blown out on my screen but I don''t find that too much of a distraction.</td>', 'Interesting perspective and good DOF for this shot.  I do like the model''s expression and the curly "hair."  Whites look a little blown out on my screen but I don''t find that too much of a distraction.', '2008-01-09 09:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377001, 630435, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ah, the ever-popular balloon animal trick!  Good idea for this challenge.  The image is quite astoundingly colorful; EVERYTHING clashes.  Quite appropriate for a clown.</td>', 'Ah, the ever-popular balloon animal trick!  Good idea for this challenge.  The image is quite astoundingly colorful; EVERYTHING clashes.  Quite appropriate for a clown.', '2008-01-09 09:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377005, 630586, 65234, '<td valign="top">So, not the funny kind of joker, right (j/k)?  Dark and broody, no catchlights to humanize the eyes and the mouth looks particularly unpleasant.  Good job.</td>', 'So, not the funny kind of joker, right (j/k)?  Dark and broody, no catchlights to humanize the eyes and the mouth looks particularly unpleasant.  Good job.', '2008-01-09 09:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377012, 630286, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea to highlight the kid art.  The non-kid stuff is rather distracting; I would have cropped out the stuff on the shelf (or removed it before shooting) and moved the wires out of the shot.  Selective desat does draw my eye to the clown but the picture is still very, very busy.</td>', 'Interesting idea to highlight the kid art.  The non-kid stuff is rather distracting; I would have cropped out the stuff on the shelf (or removed it before shooting) and moved the wires out of the shot.  Selective desat does draw my eye to the clown but the picture is still very, very busy.', '2008-01-09 09:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377024, 630779, 65234, '<td valign="top">Now I see why some people are afraid of clowns :::shudder:::  I might like to see him (in an image, mind you, not in person) with a stark black background or at least less light in back, given his demeanor and makeup.</td>', 'Now I see why some people are afraid of clowns :::shudder:::  I might like to see him (in an image, mind you, not in person) with a stark black background or at least less light in back, given his demeanor and makeup.', '2008-01-09 09:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377033, 630733, 65234, '<td valign="top">I can see where it''s clown-like but it''s not quite enough to make this a pleasing image to me, and as a shot of graffiti and some brush it doesn''t quite grab me, either.  Nice try, though.</td>', 'I can see where it''s clown-like but it''s not quite enough to make this a pleasing image to me, and as a shot of graffiti and some brush it doesn''t quite grab me, either.  Nice try, though.', '2008-01-09 09:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377053, 630728, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure what story you''re telling here.  Image is almost but not quite high key, and makeup is distractingly blotchy.  If you were going for "seeing the person in the clown face" I think the makeup should have been done well, so my eye was immediately drawn to the model''s eye instead of the makeup.</td>', 'Not quite sure what story you''re telling here.  Image is almost but not quite high key, and makeup is distractingly blotchy.  If you were going for "seeing the person in the clown face" I think the makeup should have been done well, so my eye was immediately drawn to the model''s eye instead of the makeup.', '2008-01-09 09:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377058, 630307, 65234, '<td valign="top">OK, colorful, cheerful, could use a bit more light on the curly-headed one''s face, although this is generally well-lit.</td>', 'OK, colorful, cheerful, could use a bit more light on the curly-headed one''s face, although this is generally well-lit.', '2008-01-09 09:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377074, 629286, 65234, '<td valign="top">Post-performance where people threw wet things at you and made your makeup run?  Seriously, the model''s expression works but the makeup isn''t just runny under the eye, it''s also blurred above it ... I think the story would have worked better for me if the makeup out of tear range were still intact.  Still a good entry.</td>', 'Post-performance where people threw wet things at you and made your makeup run?  Seriously, the model''s expression works but the makeup isn''t just runny under the eye, it''s also blurred above it ... I think the story would have worked better for me if the makeup out of tear range were still intact.  Still a good entry.', '2008-01-09 09:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377080, 629522, 65234, '<td valign="top">OK idea and pose works, though I''d prefer the whole of the foot in the foreground to be in the shot.  The lighting is harsh; maybe move the model farther from the wall and use some fill light or bounce the flash to soften it.</td>', 'OK idea and pose works, though I''d prefer the whole of the foot in the foreground to be in the shot.  The lighting is harsh; maybe move the model farther from the wall and use some fill light or bounce the flash to soften it.', '2008-01-09 09:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377089, 630280, 50531, '<td valign="top">YIKES</td>', 'YIKES', '2008-01-09 09:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377093, 630725, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not working for me; that''s one of those distance-measuring devices being used by a Park Service ranger-type.  If it looked like he was giving any consideration to balancing on it I''d buy into it but he looks pretty expressionless from this angle.  As an image (apart from the challenge) it''s OK.  A little noisy, composition is OK; wish the bird was watching him or something to add a little more interest.</td>', 'Not working for me; that''s one of those distance-measuring devices being used by a Park Service ranger-type.  If it looked like he was giving any consideration to balancing on it I''d buy into it but he looks pretty expressionless from this angle.  As an image (apart from the challenge) it''s OK.  A little noisy, composition is OK; wish the bird was watching him or something to add a little more interest.', '2008-01-09 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377094, 629951, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the lighting; funky border ;-)</td>', 'Nice job on the lighting; funky border ;-)', '2008-01-09 09:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
