(4377132, 630478, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oooh, a real clown!  Nice bokeh in the lights back behind him ... and a Santa?  Huh.  Interesting place you found!</td>', 'Oooh, a real clown!  Nice bokeh in the lights back behind him ... and a Santa?  Huh.  Interesting place you found!', '2008-01-09 09:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377136, 630699, 65234, '<td valign="top">This is going to sound ghoulish but the indentation the head is making and the little bit I can see of the background cloth looks like the inside of a coffin!  Nice stark image, though.</td>', 'This is going to sound ghoulish but the indentation the head is making and the little bit I can see of the background cloth looks like the inside of a coffin!  Nice stark image, though.', '2008-01-09 09:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377150, 630784, 65234, '<td valign="top">Confused viewer.  Why is he partially made up?  Why isn''t he wearing a shirt?  What kind of clown is he, and why is he confused?  He is gently lit and the angle and crop are nice, but the whole story is not here.  That''s OK; it doesn''t harm the viewer to wonder a bit, if that''s what you want us to do.</td>', 'Confused viewer.  Why is he partially made up?  Why isn''t he wearing a shirt?  What kind of clown is he, and why is he confused?  He is gently lit and the angle and crop are nice, but the whole story is not here.  That''s OK; it doesn''t harm the viewer to wonder a bit, if that''s what you want us to do.', '2008-01-09 10:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377157, 630719, 65234, '<td valign="top">Well-lit, catchlights are dead center in the eyes.  Can''t decide if the flaws in the makeup add too much character to be truly "lifeless."  Nice job overall.</td>', 'Well-lit, catchlights are dead center in the eyes.  Can''t decide if the flaws in the makeup add too much character to be truly "lifeless."  Nice job overall.', '2008-01-09 10:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377163, 630276, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the angled composition and POV; think it would have even more impact if the makeup on the eyes was still intact so the curve of the downcast eyes jumped out more.</td>', 'Like the angled composition and POV; think it would have even more impact if the makeup on the eyes was still intact so the curve of the downcast eyes jumped out more.', '2008-01-09 10:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377168, 630280, 65234, '<td valign="top">What is it with all the demented clowns in this challenge!!!  Good lighting and composition and no possibility of a viewer misinterpreting the clown''s intentions ;-)  Nit:  the knife should be a little farther up in the air so we can see the nice, sharp point on it.  A glint on the slightly-repositioned knife would make this sublime.</td>', 'What is it with all the demented clowns in this challenge!!!  Good lighting and composition and no possibility of a viewer misinterpreting the clown''s intentions ;-)  Nit:  the knife should be a little farther up in the air so we can see the nice, sharp point on it.  A glint on the slightly-repositioned knife would make this sublime.', '2008-01-09 10:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377169, 630073, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and interesting alternative challenge interpretation.  Image itself is not quite as sharp as I''d like.</td>', 'Nice pose and interesting alternative challenge interpretation.  Image itself is not quite as sharp as I''d like.', '2008-01-09 10:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377171, 628532, 65234, '<td valign="top">Colorful clown (and a cheerful one; nice change of pace!).  I''d crop out the background entirely as I find it distracting, and might try a shooting from a different angle to add a little more interest.</td>', 'Colorful clown (and a cheerful one; nice change of pace!).  I''d crop out the background entirely as I find it distracting, and might try a shooting from a different angle to add a little more interest.', '2008-01-09 10:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
