(4377824, 629286, 86849, '<td valign="top">i love all about this image, the focus on the eyes, the smudged paint, she deep sadness, the off centre and the background fits well. but i will give 9 fore one wee point, its a liiiitle bit too flat, a slightly more curves would have done the job here, just my oppinion</td>', 'i love all about this image, the focus on the eyes, the smudged paint, she deep sadness, the off centre and the background fits well. but i will give 9 fore one wee point, its a liiiitle bit too flat, a slightly more curves would have done the job here, just my oppinion', '2008-01-09 13:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377863, 630586, 85886, '<td valign="top">Brilliant in both interpretation and simplicity.  The expression (great snarl!) and makeup are brilliant and the lighting gives the eyes such depth.  My favourite of the lot and a solid 10.</td>', 'Brilliant in both interpretation and simplicity.  The expression (great snarl!) and makeup are brilliant and the lighting gives the eyes such depth.  My favourite of the lot and a solid 10.', '2008-01-09 13:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377866, 630708, 55212, '<td valign="top">Ewwww!<br/>:p</td>', 'Ewwww!:p', '2008-01-09 13:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377867, 630708, 85886, '<td valign="top">Brilliantly haunting photo.  You''ve really captured the ''maniac clown'' and the grin is genuinely freaky.  I love the textures from the cracked facepaint and blood on the teeth, plus I like the desaturated look of it to keep it dark and moody.  Nice job.</td>', 'Brilliantly haunting photo.  You''ve really captured the ''maniac clown'' and the grin is genuinely freaky.  I love the textures from the cracked facepaint and blood on the teeth, plus I like the desaturated look of it to keep it dark and moody.  Nice job.', '2008-01-09 13:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377868, 630725, 60047, '<td valign="top">DNMC. OOF. Tilted.</td>', 'DNMC. OOF. Tilted.', '2008-01-09 13:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377870, 630256, 86849, '<td valign="top">i think this is Judi and her little daughter again ;) very simila pose to the JUST THINKING and the eyes somhow simillar :) nice image</td>', 'i think this is Judi and her little daughter again ;) very simila pose to the JUST THINKING and the eyes somhow simillar :) nice image', '2008-01-09 13:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4377872, 629695, 85886, '<td valign="top">Obviously great contrast of colours and textures and I think I like the processing.  It gives it a painted feel and makes the clown almost cartoony to me.  Lovely image.</td>', 'Obviously great contrast of colours and textures and I think I like the processing.  It gives it a painted feel and makes the clown almost cartoony to me.  Lovely image.', '2008-01-09 13:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
