(4379226, 630808, 60047, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully creepy. This is such a good clown face that I want it cropped so I can see more of it and less of the white thing in the foreground.</td>', 'Wonderfully creepy. This is such a good clown face that I want it cropped so I can see more of it and less of the white thing in the foreground.', '2008-01-09 20:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379228, 630478, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great shot &amp; colors. I am bothered by the locks in front of his right eye.</td>', 'Great shot & colors. I am bothered by the locks in front of his right eye.', '2008-01-09 20:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379230, 629522, 60047, '<td valign="top">Goofy - but I''ll take it. Great expression on the model.</td>', 'Goofy - but I''ll take it. Great expression on the model.', '2008-01-09 20:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379232, 628579, 73452, '<td valign="top">yea, you wouldnt want to run into that in an alley!  great blurred background.</td>', 'yea, you wouldnt want to run into that in an alley!  great blurred background.', '2008-01-09 20:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379239, 629707, 60047, '<td valign="top">The shadow really detracts from this. I like the clever border.</td>', 'The shadow really detracts from this. I like the clever border.', '2008-01-09 20:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379243, 629286, 60047, '<td valign="top">Interesting crop. Fascinating expression. I like the negative space.</td>', 'Interesting crop. Fascinating expression. I like the negative space.', '2008-01-09 20:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379249, 630782, 60047, '<td valign="top">I wish that right eye was not blocked! Love the costume.</td>', 'I wish that right eye was not blocked! Love the costume.', '2008-01-09 20:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379261, 630235, 60047, '<td valign="top">I like the crop, the negative space and the wonderful evilness of the clown. I just wish the depth of field was broader so that the entire figure was more sharply focused.</td>', 'I like the crop, the negative space and the wonderful evilness of the clown. I just wish the depth of field was broader so that the entire figure was more sharply focused.', '2008-01-09 20:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379264, 629402, 60047, '<td valign="top">I think this would work better if the models were capture with their eyes visible to the viewer (the rear model is almost there).</td>', 'I think this would work better if the models were capture with their eyes visible to the viewer (the rear model is almost there).', '2008-01-09 20:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379279, 629951, 60047, '<td valign="top">Of all the figurine shots I''ve seen so far, this is the best regarding the technicals. The lighting is nice and even. The exposure isn''t blowing out the whites. The background is complimentary of the subject and the challenge theme. The focus and DOF are spot on. Great job.</td>', 'Of all the figurine shots I''ve seen so far, this is the best regarding the technicals. The lighting is nice and even. The exposure isn''t blowing out the whites. The background is complimentary of the subject and the challenge theme. The focus and DOF are spot on. Great job.', '2008-01-09 20:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379291, 630786, 60047, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of smoking material for the clown!?! I wish the DOF would have preserved that great bow. Neat expression on his face. Interesting crop choice - very intimate.</td>', 'Interesting choice of smoking material for the clown!?! I wish the DOF would have preserved that great bow. Neat expression on his face. Interesting crop choice - very intimate.', '2008-01-09 20:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379305, 630607, 60047, '<td valign="top">Interestingly, the clay tears and nose take away from what would otherwise be a great B &amp; W.</td>', 'Interestingly, the clay tears and nose take away from what would otherwise be a great B & W.', '2008-01-09 20:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379309, 630719, 60047, '<td valign="top">Fascinating expression. Nice artistic crop..</td>', 'Fascinating expression. Nice artistic crop..', '2008-01-09 20:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379316, 630779, 60047, '<td valign="top">Just a tad to light on the upper left vs the darkness on the lower right. What a great evil clown! How did you get the eyes to be so wonderfully captivating?</td>', 'Just a tad to light on the upper left vs the darkness on the lower right. What a great evil clown! How did you get the eyes to be so wonderfully captivating?', '2008-01-09 20:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379318, 630699, 60047, '<td valign="top">Very artistic.</td>', 'Very artistic.', '2008-01-09 20:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379325, 630080, 60047, '<td valign="top">Needs better DOF focus and more balanced illumination.</td>', 'Needs better DOF focus and more balanced illumination.', '2008-01-09 20:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379329, 628532, 60047, '<td valign="top">The light is a bit flat and the subject is a bit out of focus. Great color combo on the clown.</td>', 'The light is a bit flat and the subject is a bit out of focus. Great color combo on the clown.', '2008-01-09 20:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379342, 630286, 60047, '<td valign="top">The centering does not help. The hanging cords hurt. The crop is too large. The effort here is too minimal.</td>', 'The centering does not help. The hanging cords hurt. The crop is too large. The effort here is too minimal.', '2008-01-09 20:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379351, 628647, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice, crisp and clean image.</td>', 'Nice, crisp and clean image.', '2008-01-09 20:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379352, 630256, 60047, '<td valign="top">Didn''t I just see this child pose in this manner in another challenge?!! I love the bright colors against the black. Great make-up.</td>', 'Didn''t I just see this child pose in this manner in another challenge?!! I love the bright colors against the black. Great make-up.', '2008-01-09 20:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4379355, 629861, 60047, '<td valign="top">Fantastic concept and composition. The clown face is a bit blown out - but I am guessing this is on the video. The relative large amount of negative space makes me want a bit of a closer crop.</td>', 'Fantastic concept and composition. The clown face is a bit blown out - but I am guessing this is on the video. The relative large amount of negative space makes me want a bit of a closer crop.', '2008-01-09 20:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
