(4379360, 630784, 60047, '<td valign="top">I like the mood evoked by the darkness and the expression of the model, however, I think you might want to brighten it just a tad to bring in more detail. Also, it appears as if the focus is not quite as sharp as it could be.</td>', 'I like the mood evoked by the darkness and the expression of the model, however, I think you might want to brighten it just a tad to bring in more detail. Also, it appears as if the focus is not quite as sharp as it could be.', '2008-01-09 20:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
