(4380387, 630275, 53964, '<td valign="top">A fun, whimsical concept :)<br/> I think it would have been compositionally stronger if the extra gumball-space had been to our right (the direction his body is facing). It''s a little soft (do you sharpen after resizing to dpc-size) and, IMO, could use a bit more contrast to make the colours really pop, but I still like it!</td>', 'A fun, whimsical concept :) I think it would have been compositionally stronger if the extra gumball-space had been to our right (the direction his body is facing). It''s a little soft (do you sharpen after resizing to dpc-size) and, IMO, could use a bit more contrast to make the colours really pop, but I still like it!', '2008-01-10 02:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
