(4391371, 630808, 88825, '<td valign="top">I like the way you used lighting. It''s a great picture.</td>', 'I like the way you used lighting. It''s a great picture.', '2008-01-14 13:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4391378, 630256, 88825, '<td valign="top">It''s nice and bright. I like the color.</td>', 'It''s nice and bright. I like the color.', '2008-01-14 13:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4391379, 630073, 88825, '<td valign="top">good timing!</td>', 'good timing!', '2008-01-14 13:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4391484, 630586, 34659, '<td valign="top">Just awesome...</td>', 'Just awesome...', '2008-01-14 14:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4391485, 630779, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is great - scary as hell - but GREAT!</td>', 'This is great - scary as hell - but GREAT!', '2008-01-14 14:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4391546, 629950, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good idea using b/w on such a colorful subject. The high contrast was a must, and this was well done. That foam nose just pops out at me.</td>', 'Good idea using b/w on such a colorful subject. The high contrast was a must, and this was well done. That foam nose just pops out at me.', '2008-01-14 15:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4391550, 628579, 83313, '<td valign="top">Funny how clowns can look that way. Maybe it''s just due to decades of cheap horror films. I''m afraid this one just looks like a good snapshot.</td>', 'Funny how clowns can look that way. Maybe it''s just due to decades of cheap horror films. I''m afraid this one just looks like a good snapshot.', '2008-01-14 15:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4391562, 630235, 83313, '<td valign="top">The composition works, gives it a "surprise" effect. I think it needs a little sharpening and perhaps a minor color tweak.</td>', 'The composition works, gives it a "surprise" effect. I think it needs a little sharpening and perhaps a minor color tweak.', '2008-01-14 15:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4391566, 630678, 83313, '<td valign="top">The harsh flash kinda hurts this.</td>', 'The harsh flash kinda hurts this.', '2008-01-14 15:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4391574, 630725, 83313, '<td valign="top">Where''s that shoehorn when you really need it? I think that is a measuring device he is using. Maybe it does not strike me as fitting the challenge because I know what the device is?<br/> <br/>Lots of blur and high ISO noise.</td>', 'Where''s that shoehorn when you really need it? I think that is a measuring device he is using. Maybe it does not strike me as fitting the challenge because I know what the device is? Lots of blur and high ISO noise.', '2008-01-14 15:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4391576, 630682, 83313, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little harsh and it could probably use a touch more sharpening.</td>', 'The lighting is a little harsh and it could probably use a touch more sharpening.', '2008-01-14 15:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4391584, 630728, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not to my own taste, but I do think this is good.</td>', 'Not to my own taste, but I do think this is good.', '2008-01-14 15:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4391587, 630733, 83313, '<td valign="top">Stretching the theme, but I do see the resemblance.</td>', 'Stretching the theme, but I do see the resemblance.', '2008-01-14 15:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4391589, 630276, 83313, '<td valign="top">This one is great. Bold colors and nice clear details.</td>', 'This one is great. Bold colors and nice clear details.', '2008-01-14 15:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4391610, 630290, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bit different, and pretty good.</td>', 'A bit different, and pretty good.', '2008-01-14 15:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4391614, 630808, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ahhh!! A scary clown! <br/> <br/>Not sure I care for the comp, primarily that out of focus item on the left, but otherwise this is pretty decent.</td>', 'Ahhh!! A scary clown!  Not sure I care for the comp, primarily that out of focus item on the left, but otherwise this is pretty decent.', '2008-01-14 15:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4391619, 629707, 83313, '<td valign="top">Harsh flash here. I''m afraid that hurts this a lot. A perspective view may have helped a bit as well.</td>', 'Harsh flash here. I''m afraid that hurts this a lot. A perspective view may have helped a bit as well.', '2008-01-14 15:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4391699, 630435, 43774, '<td valign="top">Fun, bright, colourful, just the way a clown photo should be. 10</td>', 'Fun, bright, colourful, just the way a clown photo should be. 10', '2008-01-14 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4392031, 630708, 48043, '<td valign="top">This is a really good idea. Unfortunately either there is too much light on the hand or not enough light on the face depending on what your were trying to achieve. Either way the hand has too much focus because of the wrong light distribution.</td>', 'This is a really good idea. Unfortunately either there is too much light on the hand or not enough light on the face depending on what your were trying to achieve. Either way the hand has too much focus because of the wrong light distribution.', '2008-01-14 18:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4392104, 630708, 35513, '<td valign="top">OMG, I''ve never been scared of clowns, but THIS ONE!!!  Dear god!  Nicely done!!</td>', 'OMG, I''ve never been scared of clowns, but THIS ONE!!!  Dear god!  Nicely done!!', '2008-01-14 19:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4392105, 630080, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice set-up, but I wish there was just a hair more light.</td>', 'Very nice set-up, but I wish there was just a hair more light.', '2008-01-14 19:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4392106, 630290, 35513, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this shot!!  Great idea and fabulous execution!!</td>', 'I LOVE this shot!!  Great idea and fabulous execution!!', '2008-01-14 19:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4392366, 630125, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the red, white and black - very powerful colors. For me, I wish the neck was completely white and not that little bit of red.</td>', 'I like the red, white and black - very powerful colors. For me, I wish the neck was completely white and not that little bit of red.', '2008-01-14 21:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4392371, 630073, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hah, ha, hah! You get a point for a creative title. For me, had the overall quality  been a bit sharper, I would have scored it better.</td>', 'Hah, ha, hah! You get a point for a creative title. For me, had the overall quality  been a bit sharper, I would have scored it better.', '2008-01-14 21:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4392379, 629522, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. I''m not crazy about the shadows or the foot cut off in the foreground. I do like her expression though and the dunce cap adds to the fun of it.</td>', 'Cute idea. I''m not crazy about the shadows or the foot cut off in the foreground. I do like her expression though and the dunce cap adds to the fun of it.', '2008-01-14 21:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4392381, 630331, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this isn''t a bad photo. I do find the background distracting - especially the reddish areas. I like the focu on the clown''s face.</td>', 'For me, this isn''t a bad photo. I do find the background distracting - especially the reddish areas. I like the focu on the clown''s face.', '2008-01-14 21:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4392407, 630478, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the clown itself. For me, the background is very busy and distracting though.</td>', 'I like the clown itself. For me, the background is very busy and distracting though.', '2008-01-14 21:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4392414, 630307, 41675, '<td valign="top">It''s a cute photo of clown dolls. For me, there''s nothing special to make it really stand out from the others. Their smiles make me smile though.</td>', 'It''s a cute photo of clown dolls. For me, there''s nothing special to make it really stand out from the others. Their smiles make me smile though.', '2008-01-14 21:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4392434, 630080, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cute little setup. For me, I like the spotlight, I just wish there was a hint more light on the right hand side.</td>', 'Cute little setup. For me, I like the spotlight, I just wish there was a hint more light on the right hand side.', '2008-01-14 21:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4392454, 630235, 41675, '<td valign="top">Quite the demented little clown, isn''t he? I like the composition. The lighting is a bit too strong perhaps, but not a bad image all the way around.</td>', 'Quite the demented little clown, isn''t he? I like the composition. The lighting is a bit too strong perhaps, but not a bad image all the way around.', '2008-01-14 21:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4392462, 629951, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice, bright, solid colors. Not crazy about the border personally, but that''s just me.</td>', 'Nice, bright, solid colors. Not crazy about the border personally, but that''s just me.', '2008-01-14 21:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4392465, 630649, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cute and creative take on the challenge. Thinking outside the preverbal box - I like that. Bumping up a point after second look.</td>', 'Cute and creative take on the challenge. Thinking outside the preverbal box - I like that. Bumping up a point after second look.', '2008-01-14 21:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4392514, 629274, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cute little figures and I like the solid background. For me, if there was some other element or maybe set up differently to make it more interesting, I would score it higher.</td>', 'Cute little figures and I like the solid background. For me, if there was some other element or maybe set up differently to make it more interesting, I would score it higher.', '2008-01-14 21:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4392520, 630782, 41675, '<td valign="top">Oh my - poor little guy! I sure hope he (or she) got some treats after this - like a t-bone steak! Bumping up after second look.. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Oh my - poor little guy! I sure hope he (or she) got some treats after this - like a t-bone steak! Bumping up after second look.. Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-14 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4392521, 630725, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this is a bit of a stretch for the challenge. I do like the simplicity of your composition though.</td>', 'For me, this is a bit of a stretch for the challenge. I do like the simplicity of your composition though.', '2008-01-14 21:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4392528, 628647, 41675, '<td valign="top">I really like her makeup. Great colors. The thing sticking out of her shoulder is a bit distracting for me as is the strap on the opposite shoulder. Without those two things and perhaps a less busy background, I would have scored it even higher. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really like her makeup. Great colors. The thing sticking out of her shoulder is a bit distracting for me as is the strap on the opposite shoulder. Without those two things and perhaps a less busy background, I would have scored it even higher. Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-14 21:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
