(4394426, 630682, 88962, '<td valign="top">i think that maybe i would have used a differnt backround if i was tacking this picture. But other than that, it is a good idea.</td>', 'i think that maybe i would have used a differnt backround if i was tacking this picture. But other than that, it is a good idea.', '2008-01-15 18:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
