(4395345, 630256, 75034, '<td valign="top">Judi I knew this was you and I told my wife you were on your way to another ribbon. You are on a roll girl, but I do think you should slow down a bit so I can catch up to you in the ribbon race. It shouldn''t take me any longer than 200 years at my current pace.<br/> <br/>YOU ROCK JUDI</td>', 'Judi I knew this was you and I told my wife you were on your way to another ribbon. You are on a roll girl, but I do think you should slow down a bit so I can catch up to you in the ribbon race. It shouldn''t take me any longer than 200 years at my current pace. YOU ROCK JUDI', '2008-01-16 00:09:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4395346, 630586, 85886, '<td valign="top">I''m staggered that you didn''t blue with this image.  Cutesy wins every time around here apparently but I for one absolutely appreciate the ''darkness'' of this shot.  Oh, and with eyes and expression like that no-one is looking at those hairs above your ear, trust me on this one :)</td>', 'I''m staggered that you didn''t blue with this image.  Cutesy wins every time around here apparently but I for one absolutely appreciate the ''darkness'' of this shot.  Oh, and with eyes and expression like that no-one is looking at those hairs above your ear, trust me on this one :)', '2008-01-16 00:10:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4395349, 630586, 61961, '<td valign="top">Congrats on making the top ten.  This was my favorite of all the clown photos.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congrats on making the top ten.  This was my favorite of all the clown photos. ', '2008-01-16 00:11:34.000000', NULL, 0),
