(4400917, 629274, 87719, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for your comments. I don''t know why, but I shot this at f3.5 whereas I usually shoot my macros at f8 or smaller.<br/>I guess I was too busy concentrating on getting the composition just so and overlooked the aperture setting. I''m pretty sure that is why the hand on the left-most clown appears out of focus. I''ll try to do better next time.<br/>BTW Where do you guys get the clown stuff from? I had no idea where to look for a clown or even clown clothes!</td>', 'Thanks everyone for your comments. I don''t know why, but I shot this at f3.5 whereas I usually shoot my macros at f8 or smaller.I guess I was too busy concentrating on getting the composition just so and overlooked the aperture setting. I''m pretty sure that is why the hand on the left-most clown appears out of focus. I''ll try to do better next time.BTW Where do you guys get the clown stuff from? I had no idea where to look for a clown or even clown clothes!', '2008-01-17 18:00:37.000000', NULL, 0),
