(4938546, 628579, 98210, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MaryO:</b></div><hr/><i> No, I''ve seen some truly evil clowns in this challenge and this one just doesn''t look evil to me.  More like a rodeo-type clown, actually.  Nice DOF and exposure to show this clown off. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You are so right. Besides being a Zoot Suit Clown, Veekay is also a rodeo clown.<br/>This year he was part of the cattle drive at the OC Fair.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by MaryO: No, I''ve seen some truly evil clowns in this challenge and this one just doesn''t look evil to me.  More like a rodeo-type clown, actually.  Nice DOF and exposure to show this clown off.   You are so right. Besides being a Zoot Suit Clown, Veekay is also a rodeo clown.This year he was part of the cattle drive at the OC Fair. ', '2008-09-06 14:57:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4938559, 628579, 98210, '<td valign="top">Looking at most of the pictures, it seems that Veekay the Clown is the only professional circus clown in the bunch.</td>', 'Looking at most of the pictures, it seems that Veekay the Clown is the only professional circus clown in the bunch.', '2008-09-06 15:07:05.000000', NULL, 0),
